# k.objects/shards/places: street, building, prison, jail, restaurant, airport, temple, library, theater, museum, fort, warehouse, wall, roof, lane, alley, path, pool. Parts with a primitive shape, a box in the 0 to 100 frame
# of the object (x right, y down), a draw order z and typical colours; points for lines and polygons.
# sources: hand-core 1 (hand-written in this repository)
# license: CC0-1.0
# script: none (hand-written)

# street
